request.description:
**GET** `/api/v1/payout-corridors?asset=USD&country=GE`

**200 example:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "corridors": [
      {
        "asset": "USD",
        "country": "GE",
        "destinationType": "wire",
        "beneficiaryType": "business",
        "payoutRailLabel": "Fedwire",
        "amount": { "min": 30, "max": 300000, "currency": "USD" }
      }
    ],
    "truncated": false
  }
}
```

**`payoutRailLabel`** — human-readable rail name from Palremit (e.g. `Fedwire`, `Bank Transfer`, `Nequi`); `null` when absent. **404** `CORRIDOR_UNSUPPORTED` — tuple not in Palremit catalogue. **502** — Palremit unavailable.

**GET** `/api/v1/payout-corridors/requirements?asset&country&destinationType&beneficiaryType`

**200 example (truncated):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "corridor": {
      "asset": "USD",
      "country": "GE",
      "destinationType": "wire",
      "beneficiaryType": "business",
      "payoutRailLabel": "Fedwire"
    },
    "destinationFields": [
      { "path": "account_number", "type": "string", "required": true, "label": "Account number" },
      { "path": "bank_code", "type": "string", "required": true, "label": "Bank code" }
    ],
    "destinationTemplate": {
      "beneficiary": { "type": "business" }
    },
    "amount": { "min": 30, "max": 300000, "currency": "USD" }
  }
}
```

Build the UI form from `destinationFields` (respect `conditional_required`). Submit user input as **`destination`** on **Create Account (offramp)** — **snake_case**, no `payout_rail`.

